      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Alert:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize Alert').first().json, null, 2) }}",
        "hasOutputParser": false,
        "needsFallback": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the Triage agent of an autonomous incident responder. The service is `backend` (Node.js/Express on Alternate Clouds).\n\nCall get_health_status exactly once, then classify:\n- P1: status down/unreachable, or errorRate >= 0.5\n- P2: status degraded, or errorRate >= 0.2, or the alert reports 5xx on a business endpoint\n- P3: some errors but the service mostly works\n- P4: no impact / noise\ngo = true for P1, P2 and P3; false for P4.\n\nAnswer with ONLY one JSON object, no prose, no code fences:\n{\"severity\":\"P1|P2|P3|P4\",\"affected_service\":\"backend\",\"go\":true,\"summary\":\"<one sentence>\",\"health\":{\"status\":\"...\",\"errorRate\":0,\"version\":\"...\"}}",
          "maxIterations": 4,
          "enableStreaming": false
        }
      }
    },
